<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.8">
<l>vaṇṇa mālvarai yēkuṭai yāka</l>
<l rend="indent">māri kāttava ṉēmatu cūtā</l>
<l>kaṇṇa ṉēkari kōḷviṭut tāṉē</l>
<l rend="indent">kāra ṇākaḷi ṟaṭṭapi rāṉē</l>
<l>yeṇṇu vāriṭa raikkaḷai vāṉē</l>
<l rend="indent">yētta rumperuṅ kīrttiyi ṉāṉē</l>
<l>naṇṇi nāṉuṉṉai nāḷtoṟu mēttum</l>
<l rend="indent">naṉmai yēyaruḷ ceyempi rāṉē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>You who held back the rain with a dark mountain</l>
<l rend="indent">as an umbrella, Madhusūdana!</l>
<l>Kaṇṇaṉ! You who release the elephant from torment!</l>
<l rend="indent">Source! Lord who conquered the elephant!</l>
<l>You who removes distress from those who contemplate you!</l>
<l rend="indent">You with fame [so] great it is difficult to praise!</l>
<l>Our Lord, graciously grant [me] the goodness that,</l>
<l rend="indent">being united [with you], I might praise you each day!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
